<title>JAPAN: Sankyo Aluminium - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sankyo Aluminium - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		125.19		vs	  123.49</p>
<p> Operating	    1.22		vs	    1.31</p>
<p> Current	    725    million	  vs	  172    million</p>
<p> Net		  242    million	  vs	  401    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.95 yen	  vs	    1.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    255 million	  vs	 255 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sankyo Aluminium Industry Co Ltd is a manufacturer of aluminium shutters.</p>
